       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Updated the player credits list;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Fixed various text issues and optimized related gameplay experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you encounter any issues while playing, please feel free to contact us with your feedback. We will continue to follow up and resolve issues as quickly as possible.",
